{"unit_id": "xiaoyuink__dsh-image-vision#feature-1", "repo": "xiaoyuink/dsh-image-vision", "commit": "a445f8437a9e1cdddaf4ded34b5d863bd1785b0d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-image-vision 的功能「图片分析」：传入图片引用后，工具先检查当前模型是否支持视觉：支持时按预设或自定义提示词交给当前模型；否则调用设置中启用的视觉供应商。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2193-2255"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaoyuink__dsh-image-vision#feature-2", "repo": "xiaoyuink/dsh-image-vision", "commit": "a445f8437a9e1cdddaf4ded34b5d863bd1785b0d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-image-vision 的功能「图片文字识别」：工具读取图片并请求视觉模型按阅读顺序输出可见文字；无法确定的字符会标为问号，没有文字时返回无文字。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2385-2413"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaoyuink__dsh-image-vision#feature-3", "repo": "xiaoyuink/dsh-image-vision", "commit": "a445f8437a9e1cdddaf4ded34b5d863bd1785b0d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-image-vision 的功能「目标定位与裁剪」：用户描述要找的物体或文字后，工具返回其像素坐标框；再将坐标交给裁剪工具，可截取并放大局部供继续识别。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2283-2383"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaoyuink__dsh-image-vision#feature-4", "repo": "xiaoyuink/dsh-image-vision", "commit": "a445f8437a9e1cdddaf4ded34b5d863bd1785b0d", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-image-vision 的功能「对话框添加图片」：Web 对话框提供添加图片入口，也支持粘贴或拖入图片；发送时图片上传到 DSH 附件存储，并在消息中使用图片引用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:35-42"]}
{"unit_id": "xiaoyuink__dsh-image-vision#caveat-1", "repo": "xiaoyuink/dsh-image-vision", "commit": "a445f8437a9e1cdddaf4ded34b5d863bd1785b0d", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-image-vision 使用备用视觉模型分析图片时，会把图片内容发送到用户配置的视觉服务；发送图片也会写入 DSH 附件存储，附件按代码说明长期保留。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:2193-2255", "lib/client.js:35-42"]}
